 "description": "Decode a JSON Web Token's header and claims, show issued/expiry times in plain dates and whether it has expired \u2014 optionally verify an HS256/384/512 signature with a secret. Decoding does not need the key. Never paste production secrets into third-party tools you do not trust; verification here is local and nothing is stored or logged. Price: free. Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
